Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Shining Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 13
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.59,0:00:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up. No one can help you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.31,0:00:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared? It’s not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remove his Knot for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.23,0:00:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Quan, he is the King after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.47,0:00:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn’t that good?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:01:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I’m the King, do it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No I can’t treat a good King like this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.99,0:01:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is our real King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stubborn old men who are ignorant of current affairs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.71,0:01:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,there is only one King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and that’s me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.58,0:01:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever dares to disobey my order
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.80,0:01:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,will end up the same as him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.80,0:01:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,stop
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You are finally here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,what’s going on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,They both have elemental power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.35,0:01:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of power is this? It’s so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.47,0:01:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is thanks to our return to the Thorn Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since these thunder Bulala and rain Bulala are also Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can definitely eat it too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.47,0:02:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Bulala will burn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Then try something else
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.82,0:02:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Very good, got around it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.82,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Come together
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.66,0:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t back down this time
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,are you okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.79,0:02:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.07,0:02:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.75,0:02:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I just feel so tired
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.71,0:02:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.47,0:02:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong? What’s wrong with your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you look at me you look at me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So magical, so magical
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.02,0:02:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I seem to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,as well
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.78,0:02:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Such powerful energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t know how long this energy can last
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s so much more here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.43,0:02:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If it’s gone, eat it again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.39,0:02:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But how to take these Bulala away?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.79,0:03:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.51,0:03:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just open this vent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All the Bulala here will be blown into the town
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s get started
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.47,0:03:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,you see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we succeeded
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.62,0:03:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect that the element Bulala could be used in this way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You can’t win against me with this kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Father out of here
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I want to come too
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.60,0:04:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect you to be quite powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the face of my strongest power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All your efforts are in vain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be safe here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn’t matter to me. You go and help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.39,0:04:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, the king will be protected by us. It’ll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.65,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s over
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,take advantage of now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can defeat me like this? You are so naïve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.51,0:05:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If we continue fighting like this, not only will we not be able to defeat him
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid the entire Bulala world will be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you found out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.44,0:05:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The light on Uncle’s chest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.15,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.19,0:05:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,be the key
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.31,0:05:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to eat so much at one time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.27,0:05:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Still not giving up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I will make you completely despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s dangerous, get away quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky, wake up soon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.56,0:05:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to protect Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up, all the Bulala here are for me
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.67,0:05:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, I must stop you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Sparky succeeded?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a colorful fragment
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you take it away you won’t have the power anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.80,0:06:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually want to take my piece
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can take it away
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, it’s up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No; let go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Take advantage now Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Overestimating your capabilities
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.42,0:06:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are here to help too
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if there are just two more wires?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,who said that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.71,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t underestimate us
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.43,0:06:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t bully Brother Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s come too
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.01,0:07:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,no one can beat me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No hope
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.65,0:07:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t give up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone must pool their strength
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.21,0:07:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Like twisting threads together to become a rope
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right if we twist all the wires together
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely become stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.29,0:07:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right, my subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.09,0:07:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to unite again
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how united the ants are, they are just ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How could it be possible to win me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen to my order: launch
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.21,0:08:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, work hard
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why no response?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the power of unity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible. I am invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.08,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, we’re almost there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I love frying pan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no power. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone turned golden
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.45,0:09:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, could this be
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The legendary Golden Bulala?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I saw on the top of the Thorn Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that everyone was united
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,to build this beautiful place
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I found
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.53,0:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Golden Bulala I’ve been looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala is a spirit of our Bulala Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as Golden Bulala exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Bulala Kingdom will be full of vitality
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Look
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.01,0:10:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that Golden Bulala really exists
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.13,0:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.80,0:10:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.16,0:10:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope Master Quan can change his ways
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and make up for his own mistakes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s that monster
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.93,0:10:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Gone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.57,0:10:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That fragment is so dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just snatched away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky said that monster is not from this world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.32,0:10:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be related to the rift ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.94,0:10:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, this way
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.45,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect the city to be repaired so quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.50,0:10:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like this place is more beautiful than when we first arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.01,0:10:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, look over there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone is using the element Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.01,0:11:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels so good to feel everyone is united
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All thanks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.16,0:11:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you who unite all the residents of Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We will send you here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you also want to return to your own world?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It says it likes it here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.96,0:11:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it wants to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we go back
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This rift is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be careful
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to prevent monsters from entering
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.71,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ll have soldiers hold this place
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.72,0:11:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,With the ability of elemental Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it’s no problem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.80,0:11:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can leave with peace of mind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe we will meet again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:11:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We will definitely meet again
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.12,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye friends
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.83,0:12:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,here you go
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.53,0:12:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the fragments from other places as well
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
